<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
<p class="hero-sub">Last updated: August 2026</p>
</div><div class="content-wrap">
<p>Athlete Calculator ("we," "us," or "our") operates athletecalculator.com. This page explains what information we collect when you use our site, how we use it, and the choices you have.</p>
<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
<p>We do not require account creation or login to use our calculators. We collect information in the following ways:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Usage data:</strong> We use Google Analytics (GA4) to collect anonymized information about how visitors use our site — pages viewed, time on site, general location (city/country level), device type, and referral source.</li>
<li><strong>Calculator inputs:</strong> Values you enter into our calculators (such as height, weight, jump distance, or sprint time) are processed in your browser to generate results. We do not store or associate these inputs with your identity.</li>
<li><strong>Email addresses:</strong> If you voluntarily subscribe to updates through a newsletter signup form on our calculator pages, we collect your email address via MailerLite, our email service provider, solely for the purpose of sending you requested updates. You can unsubscribe at any time via the link in any email we send.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
<p>Our site uses cookies and similar tracking technologies for the following purposes:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Analytics:</strong> Google Analytics uses cookies to distinguish unique visitors and understand site usage patterns.</li>
<li><strong>Advertising:</strong> We use Google AdSense to display ads on our site. Google and its partners may use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this or other websites. You can learn more about how Google uses data and manage your ad personalization settings at <a class="inline-link" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google's Ads Policy page</a>.</li>
</ul>
<p>You can control or disable cookies through your browser settings. Disabling cookies may affect some site functionality.</p>
<div class="callout">
<strong>Third-Party Advertising</strong>
    As a Google AdSense publisher, third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this website or other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visit to our site and/or other sites on the internet.
  </div>
<h2>How We Use Information</h2>
<p>We use the information we collect to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Understand how our site is used so we can improve our calculators and content</li>
<li>Display relevant advertising through Google AdSense</li>
<li>Send requested email updates to newsletter subscribers</li>
<li>Diagnose technical issues and maintain site performance</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not sell your personal information to third parties.</p>
<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
<p>We use the following third-party services, each with their own privacy policies:</p>
<ul>
<li><a class="inline-link" href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Analytics</a></li>
<li><a class="inline-link" href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google AdSense</a></li>
<li><a class="inline-link" href="https://www.mailerlite.com/legal/privacy-policy" rel="noopener" target="_blank">MailerLite</a></li>
</ul>
<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
<p>Our calculators are used by athletes of all ages, including minors, typically alongside a parent, coach, or guardian. We do not knowingly collect personal information directly from children under 13 beyond anonymized analytics data. Calculator inputs are processed in-browser and are not stored or linked to any individual.</p>
<h2>Your Choices</h2>
<ul>
<li>You can opt out of Google Analytics tracking using the <a class="inline-link" href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</li>
<li>You can manage ad personalization through <a class="inline-link" href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Google's Ad Settings</a>.</li>
<li>You can unsubscribe from email updates at any time via the link included in every email.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in our practices or for legal, operational, or regulatory reasons. We'll update the "Last updated" date at the top of this page when changes are made.</p>
<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please visit our <a class="inline-link" href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
